<title>INDIA: Cricket-Australia 215 all out v South Africa.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Australia 215 all out v South Africa.</headline>
<dateline>FARIDABAD, India 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were all out for 215 in 47.3 of their 50 overs against South Africa in the Titan Cup limited overs triangular tournament on Friday.</p>
</text>
